        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe {0} is\nwhere you can change your job to ^7F3300Knight^000000\nor apply for the ^7F3300Culvert^000000 Subjugation Party.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n{0}是轉職為^7F3300騎士^000000\n或申請^7F3300下水道^000000討伐隊伍的地方。\n{1}"
