      ],
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe ^0000FFLibrary^000000 is\nwhere you can find useful information, like the Monster Encyclopedia.\nThere are currently two libaries available,\nOne to the {0} and the other to the {1}.\n{2}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n^0000FF圖書館^000000裡有魔物圖鑑等有用資訊。\n目前有兩家圖書館，\n一家在{0}，另一家在{1}。\n{2}"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Prontera Castle\",\"prontera,156,360\",\"^FF5400\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nThe {0} is north from here,\nand its rear gate is connected to\nthe northern Prontera Fields.\nLet me mark the castle on your mini-map.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n{0}在北方，\n其後門連線著普隆德拉野外。\n讓我在您的小地圖上標記一下王宮的位置。\n{1}"
