      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\nIf your beloved Peco Peco refuses\nto leave you,\nplease talk to the {0}\nnear the central fountain.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n如果您心愛的大嘴鳥拒絕離開您，\n請去中央噴泉附近的{0}那裡談談。\n{1}"
