      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Guide",
      "placeholders" : [
        "F_Navi(\"Leablem\",\"prontera,244,169\",\"^0000FF\")",
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Prontera Guide]\n{0}\nis a technician\nwho can create ^0000FFslots^000000 on weapons and armors,\nAs amazing as it sounds,\nnot all equipment can be slotted.\n{1}",
      "translation" : "[普隆德拉向導]\n{0}是一位技術人員，\n可以在武器和防具上製作^0000FF插槽^000000。\n雖然聽起來很神奇，\n但並非所有裝備都能鑲嵌插槽。\n{1}"
